# Visual mode: v and V, operators on the area, text objects, put, gv and repeat.

=== v then l selects
text:
  one two three
  four five six
  seven eight nine
cursor: 1,1
keys: vll
--- vim 9.1
expect-text:
  one two three
  four five six
  seven eight nine
expect-cursor: 1,3
expect-mode: visual
expect-visual: 1,1

